# REAKTON WEBSITE 2026

This workspace is the **REAKTON band website** (Next.js), not Debatefy and not DAWERSION.

- Repository: https://github.com/AdrianoDebatefy/REAKTON
- App path: repo root (or `C:\Users\adria\REAKTON` on Windows)
- Stack: Next.js 14, TypeScript, Tailwind, Framer Motion, next-intl
- Three landing columns: Cosmos (Erde), Nano, Club
- Local images only: `public/worlds/` (Erde.jpg, nano.jpg, club-bg.jpg)

When referring to this project in commits, PRs, or summaries, use **REAKTON WEBSITE 2026**.
